1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 6=

2
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,190
(Guaranteed Win)
It was at dusk that day.

3
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,960
In a strange bamboo grove
west of the city,

4
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,800
an eerie wind suddenly swept through.

5
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,520
I had uncovered the truth of the case

6
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,920
and was hurrying home

7
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,890
when suddenly, I heard...

8
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,990
And what do you think happened?

9
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,000
What happened?

10
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,400
Lu Cen's sword

11
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,280
glowed red in the setting sun

12
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,880
as it came straight at my face.

13
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,400
In the blink of an eye,

14
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:28,000
Lu Cen struck three times
with his gleaming blade.

15
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,040
I thought, I've come this far,

16
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,990
so I reached into my clothes
and pulled something out.

17
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:31,520
Bang!

18
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:32,960
And then?

19
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,600
White smoke instantly billowed out

20
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,840
and blinded that villain,

21
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,960
leaving him completely disoriented.

22
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,680
Xiaobai,

23
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:44,280
you're incredible!

24
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,000
But

25
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,120
what you did

26
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,640
was still far too dangerous.

27
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,520
What if Lu Cen comes after you again?

28
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:52,200
And there's my uncle too.

29
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:52,800
No.

30
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,120
I have to warn him.

31
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,440
What are you talking about?

32
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,480
Songpiao.

33
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,280
Xiaobai was attacked by Lu Cen

34
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,960
on her way home.

35
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,000
What exactly happened?

36
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,440
Xiaobai

37
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:09,120
learned that Cheng Gui
had been to Langjing Kingdom,

38
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,790
so she went to the docks to see

39
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,920
if anyone there had seen him.

40
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,720
But on her way back,

41
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,120
someone tried to kill her.

42
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,880
By the way, Rousang,

43
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,920
was the He Dang you mentioned before

44
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,280
the assassin who was

45
00:02:22,290 --> 00:02:23,380
caught at the scene that day?

46
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:25,400
Uncle He Dang would never kill anyone.

47
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,080
Besides, Xiaobai

48
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,360
only investigated this case

49
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,000
because of me.

50
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:31,840
Miss Xiaobai,

51
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,480
as for the Imperial Retreat case,

52
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,990
you should stop
investigating it for now.

53
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,440
Too many people are involved.

54
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,240
As for He Dang,

55
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,880
I'll find a way to help him.

56
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:54,760
Your Highness, forgive me
for not welcoming you properly.

57
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,800
Where is He Dang,

58
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,250
who was detained that day?

59
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,760
He's still in jail.

60
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,110
Take me to him.

61
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,080
Yes.

62
00:03:02,110 --> 00:03:03,040
This way, Your Highness.

63
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:06,940
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

64
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,760
Rousang.

65
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:08,720
From now on, you'd better

66
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,350
carry a pouch
of lime powder with you too.

67
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,430
If you ever run into danger,

68
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,480
you can use it like I did.

69
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:13,880
Young Lady.

70
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,840
Uncle He Dang.

71
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,480
How did you get out?

72
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,320
It was the Second Prince.

73
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:23,240
The Second Prince
went to the Zhaoming Office

74
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,440
and secured my release.

75
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,480
Xiaobai,

76
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,480
could we let Uncle He Dang

77
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,680
work here?

78
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,880
After everything that's happened,

79
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,680
Uncle certainly won't let him return.

80
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,160
You know

81
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,920
he still has an elderly mother at home.

82
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,400
As for hiring staff,

83
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,760
Rousang, you can decide.

84
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,080
Why?

85
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:44,000
Have you forgotten?

86
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,440
You're the largest
shareholder in this law firm.

87
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,120
You have the final say.

88
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,840
Xiaobai, you're the best!

89
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,800
Uncle He Dang,

90
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,680
you should stay

91
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,600
and help Xiaobai out around here.

92
00:03:55,210 --> 00:03:56,120
Thank you, Young Lady.

93
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,400
Thank you, Advocate Jiang.

94
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,080
In my view,

95
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:00,800
Lu Cen's assassination attempt

96
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,040
may not have targeted
only the Grand Tutor.

97
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:04,040
It's quite possible

98
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:05,380
that Prince Luan was the real target.

99
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,560
Then,

100
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,680
what do you think

101
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,120
we should do?

102
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,520
Mother, I respectfully ask

103
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:14,840
that you allow me

104
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,980
to deploy the Imperial Guards

105
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,360
to protect Prince Luan,

106
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:18,960
in case the assassin

107
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,080
tries something again,

108
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,990
and to ensure Prince Luan's safety.

109
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,040
My son.

110
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,240
You should know

111
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,440
that your safety

112
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,320
is what worries me most.

113
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,880
I understand

114
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,120
your concern, Mother.

115
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,920
I will be cautious at all times

116
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,920
and stay vigilant

117
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,240
to keep myself safe.

118
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,520
But

119
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:39,800
please rest assured, Mother.

120
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,080
I will

121
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,840
do everything I can to hunt down Lu Cen

122
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,520
and bring him to justice

123
00:04:44,530 --> 00:04:45,770
to prevent any further trouble,

124
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,640
restore peace

125
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,480
to the court,

126
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,720
and give you

127
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,980
no more cause for worry.

128
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,480
Good.

129
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:54,660
(Petition: The Jin Family's
Vicious Dog Bites Wuyun)

130
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,720
What are you writing?

131
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,120
A petition.

132
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,400
What kind of handwriting is that?

133
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,960
Jiang style.

134
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,200
Jiang style?

135
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,600
It's quite distinctive.

136
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,320
I slept on my hand last night.

137
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,680
It's still numb,

138
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,860
so I can barely hold a brush.

139
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,480
Want me to write it for you?

140
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,480
Sure.

141
00:05:33,020 --> 00:05:33,880
(Prince Luan's Residence)

142
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,960
Regarding the Imperial Retreat case
the other day,

143
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,840
Lu Cen

144
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,480
actually tried to harm you, Uncle.

145
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,200
He's nothing but a petty criminal

146
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,240
resorting to underhanded tricks

147
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,680
unworthy of notice.

148
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,440
But I never expected

149
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,040
such a matter

150
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,920
would cause Your Highness

151
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:50,920
so much

152
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,920
trouble

153
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,520
and even have the Imperial Guards

154
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,680
sent here to protect me.

155
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,280
Instead of

156
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,120
easing Your Highness's burdens,

157
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,560
I've only caused
Your Highness's concern.

158
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,640
I truly

159
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,440
feel deeply ashamed.

160
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:08,080
Uncle,

161
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:09,240
don't think too much of it.

162
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,920
It was Mother's wish as well.

163
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:12,720
Mother said

164
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,280
you've served the court for many years,

165
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:17,560
so naturally, you'll understand
her good intentions.

166
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,680
Her Majesty...

167
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,240
Miss Xiaobai,

168
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,280
are you satisfied?

169
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:30,660
(Wow!)

170
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:32,920
(His handwriting is beautiful!)

171
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,960
It's not bad.

172
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:35,800
By the way, Xiaobai,

173
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,080
it's getting late.

174
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:38,120
I should head back to the residence.

175
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,080
I'll come again tomorrow.

176
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,920
Goodbye, Sizhou.

177
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,200
Young Master Sizhou.

178
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:48,960
How about this?

179
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,880
I'm so busy with work every day

180
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,080
that I simply don't have time to handle

181
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,240
all this paperwork.

182
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,080
From now on,

183
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,520
you can be my secretary.

184
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,320
For things like petitions,

185
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,640
you can write them for me.

186
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,520
Don't worry.

187
00:06:59,530 --> 00:07:01,160
I won't make you
work for free. I'll pay you.

188
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,120
Give a man a fish,

189
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,440
but it's better

190
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,360
to teach him how to fish.

191
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:09,220
(Guaranteed Win)

192
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,880
First, your sitting posture.

193
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,960
Keep your head straight,

194
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,880
your back upright,

195
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:13,720
your arms open,

196
00:07:13,730 --> 00:07:14,560
and your feet steady.

197
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,400
This will keep your writing steady

198
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:17,750
and allow you to move the brush freely.

199
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,160
Second,

200
00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:22,080
when moving the brush,

201
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,380
use the center tip most of the time,

202
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,960
letting the brush tip move
smoothly through each stroke.

203
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:27,480
Use the side tip

204
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,480
and angled tip as well

205
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:30,040
to give the characters
a fuller structure...

206
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,800
All right.

207
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,120
No need for all the theory.

208
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,240
Let's just start writing.

209
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,200
I'm a quick learner.

210
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,290
I'll know how as soon as I see it.

211
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,040
Then, Miss Xiaobai,

212
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:38,320
what would you like to write?

213
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:40,920
Bao Fu.
[*Get rich]

214
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,240
"Get revenge"?
[*"Get rich" and "revenge" sound similar in Chinese]

215
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,400
"Bao Fu."

216
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,880
It means becoming very wealthy.

217
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,960
"Embrace wealth"?
[*"Get rich" and "embrace wealth" sound similar in Chinese]

218
00:07:55,580 --> 00:07:57,460
(Embrace)

219
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,680
Not that "embrace."

220
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,160
It's

221
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,580
the same character as in

222
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,360
"bad temper."

223
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,790
I'm in a very bad temper right now.

224
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,760
"Get rich."

225
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:07,440
Let's get a new sheet.

226
00:08:15,860 --> 00:08:19,300
(Get Rich)

227
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,400
Not bad.

228
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,720
I'll put it by my bed tonight.

229
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,920
Why am I always the one writing?

230
00:08:25,220 --> 00:08:25,990
You should try too.

231
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:26,880
Sure.

232
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,480
Then teach me.

233
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,960
(How can there be)

234
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,200
(such a shy
and gentle man in this world?)

235
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,560
(How can there be)

236
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,500
(such a clever and mischievous
young lady in this world?)

237
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,400
(My heart is beating so fast.)

238
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,160
(Could it be...)

239
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,880
(Forget it.)

240
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,020
Let it be.

241
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:07,070
♪The starry sky I once gazed upon♪

242
00:09:07,470 --> 00:09:10,220
♪Now falls into my eyes♪

243
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,520
What does that mean?

244
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,280
Nothing in particular.

245
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,890
It's just easy to write.

246
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:20,730
♪I've imagined
our meeting countless times♪

247
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:23,540
♪Yet this moment feels
more vivid than a dream♪

248
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,040
Your Highness.

249
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:26,000
Please have some tea.

250
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,760
Uncle, be careful!

251
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,040
Watch out!

252
00:09:58,920 --> 00:09:59,720
Don't move!

253
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,080
Who are you?

254
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,000
Why did you try to kill me?

255
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,080
Search him.

256
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:17,700
(Cen)

257
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,560
You're Lu Cen.

258
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,160
I won't hide my name

259
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,080
or deny who I am.

260
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:30,960
Now that I've fallen into your hands,

261
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,360
do what you will

262
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,360
with me.

263
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,880
Why do you want to kill me?

264
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,720
I don't just want to kill you.

265
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,980
I want to kill
every corrupt official in the court.

266
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,240
Take him to jail.

267
00:10:40,250 --> 00:10:41,520
Hold him there until further orders.

268
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,640
- Yes.
- Yes.

269
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,240
Uncle.

270
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,440
Uncle.

271
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,840
Are you hurt?

272
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,320
I'm fine.

273
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,960
Fortunately, the Second Prince
stepped in to save me.

274
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,400
Songpiao.

275
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,200
Songpiao.

276
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,840
Your hand...

277
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,480
It's nothing.

278
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,840
Just a minor injury.

279
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:08,800
Guards.

280
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,280
Take the Second Prince
to have his wound treated at once.

281
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,240
I'll go with him.

282
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,640
All right.

283
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,040
Go ahead.

284
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,440
Let's go.

285
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:26,040
(Lu Cen...)

286
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,880
(Are you really that simple?)

287
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,180
(Cen)

288
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:31,480
Report!

289
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,760
Urgent dispatch
from the northern frontier!

290
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,520
Report!

291
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:40,990
Enemy forces on the northern frontier
have suddenly launched an attack.

292
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,880
Though our border troops
are fighting to the death,

293
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:43,800
the situation is dire.

294
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:44,960
In just over ten days,

295
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,580
several of our border prefectures
have already fallen,

296
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,990
and the enemy is advancing
straight toward Bojue Kingdom.

297
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:51,100
(Enemy forces suddenly attack
the northern frontier)

298
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,760
Second Prince.

299
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,120
You summoned me here

300
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,040
late at night

301
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,240
because...

302
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,520
Victory or defeat

303
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,800
depends on every careful step.

304
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,040
One wrong move,

305
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,320
and we lose everything.

306
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,120
I can't afford to make a mistake.

307
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:14,960
So

308
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,520
I have no other choice.

309
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,800
Only by doing this

310
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,360
can we make those

311
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:22,480
watching us closely lower their guard

312
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,640
and buy us time
for what we've planned next.

313
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,880
For the goal we both share,

314
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,000
everyone

315
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,280
must make the necessary sacrifices.

316
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:39,520
Second Prince, do you mean...

317
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,560
This is my choice,

318
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:46,160
and ours as well.

319
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:50,440
No one can stand in our way.

320
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,080
As for your family,

321
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,680
I'll make sure they're well cared for.

322
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,040
Go in peace.

323
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:23,300
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

324
00:13:24,260 --> 00:13:26,660
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

325
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,060
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

326
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:31,980
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

327
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:36,860
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

328
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:40,540
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

329
00:13:41,140 --> 00:13:42,700
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

330
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:46,180
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

331
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:51,820
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

332
00:13:52,340 --> 00:13:55,420
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

333
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:58,460
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

334
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:02,500
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

335
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:05,780
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

336
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:08,860
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

337
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:11,580
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

338
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:14,820
♪I'll only say that once♪

339
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:17,060
♪I called your name♪

340
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:23,900
♪The silent stars hang low♪

341
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,500
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

342
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:30,660
♪I linger in the old tower♪

343
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:34,420
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

344
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:38,180
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

345
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:41,860
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

346
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,860
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

347
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:51,100
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

348
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:54,260
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

349
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:58,340
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

350
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:00,980
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

351
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:05,260
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

352
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:08,180
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

353
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:11,340
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

354
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:14,020
♪If we meet again in another life♪

355
00:15:14,340 --> 00:15:17,060
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

356
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:20,020
♪Was when we first met?♪

357
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:23,700
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

358
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:26,580
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
